    "insert": "\nThis proposal aims at analyzing sitting places for holographic AI. Although current methods can detect objects and its bounding box, they are incapable of analysing the exact parameters of a sitting place. This proposal aims to developing methods to determine the orientation and dimensions of a suitable sitting place. This proposal develops a method to leverage procedural generation in reinforcement learning to solve this problem.\n\n\n"
